# --- Generated results & figures (regenerate from the notebooks; never commit) ---
# Matches any `results/`, `figures/` or `.cache/` output dir at any depth, so a new
# notebook gets this for free instead of needing its own rule.
**/results/
**/figures/
**/.cache/
results.csv
*.pdf
